From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: add restricted charger transport and shared RW timeout state

Keep the legacy observer policy unchanged. Add fixed-USID2 byte reads and
atomic masked configuration updates with unique EE0 ownership, bounded v5
transactions and readback. Share poisoned RW lanes with the IRQ mux. No
charging-policy write caller is added. Optional sweetbatttransport=1 runs
one read-only preflight on the battery workloop; protections/control follow.

diff --git a/bsd/dev/sweet_spmi.c b/bsd/dev/sweet_spmi.c
--- a/bsd/dev/sweet_spmi.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/sweet_spmi.c
@@ -1,7 +1,8 @@
 /*
  * Battery observer EXT_READL and shared PMIC-arb transaction serialization.
  * Observer API remains read only. Keys and mux IRQ writes share its lock.
- * No charger configuration or PMIC write API is provided here.
+ * A separate MH2LM charger table permits bounded, verified configuration RMW.
+ * No charging policy invokes these writes until its protections are ready.
  * Initialization is serialized across battery and late board services.
  * Disjoint APIDs do not exempt commands from controller serialization.
  */
@@ -10,11 +11,15 @@
